/-! # FLOWER-LOW (L8 helper L8-I-UNITS), item I-UNITS: the piece marking, fixed markings, image markings

Main's `Flower.MkUnits.{Defs,Code,UnitGap}`: `mkAt` (the fine marking restricted to `𝒱₀(σ)`), `fixMark`,
`imageMark` and its transport, and the last member of a spine.
Copied by source (sha256 in `MkUnits/COPIED-SHA256SUMS`) onto L5a's `𝒱_γ` API (`Fama`), L6's carrier `Src` and the
other item-I sub-areas' ports; statements are main's over `𝒱_{γF}` at `γF ≤ 1/2`. Generated by the helper's
`itool/gen_u_spec.py` (L8's `gen_i_spec.py` naming). -/

@[expose] public section
