open WaveTurbulence.GammaLow.FinalCount
variable {γF : ℝ} [Fact (γF ≤ 1 / 2)]

/-- **The marking of the piece of a prescribed point** (R177, F-B4-3): the fine marking restricted to `𝒱₀(σ)`, so
that every marked vine of the piece lies in an SG group (R173).  A `MarkFn` cannot see `σ`; the restriction is made
at the piece. -/
def mkAtLow {w : ℕ} (mkF : Fama.Stage1Mk.MarkFn γF w) (a : Fama.VineA.PrescribedPrimeGarden γF w) : Set (Fama.CLVineG γF a.prime.skeleton) :=
  mkF a.prime ∩ Fama.vinesV0 γF a.prime.skeleton a.totalSigma

end

